      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.61,
      "end_seconds": 283.46,
      "duration_seconds": 33.85,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like an open fracture with a compromised blood supply. I wanna be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'm sending you for an urgent X-ray cos of open fracture. I'd like to arrange blood tests for pre-operative. I'll start you on co-amoxiclav, 1.2 grams, now, single dose. That's for open fracture."
    },
