      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.29,
      "end_seconds": 301.04,
      "duration_seconds": 14.75,
      "text": "Keep still, I am splinting the leg and sending you to theatre now. Let's get you seen by the the orthopaedic team, I'll arrange the letter. We'll catch up straight away."
    },
